Let $f:E\to\mathbb{R}$. Then
\[
D(f):=\{x\in E: f \text{ is discontinuous at } x\}
=\{x\in E: \omega(f;x)>0\}
=\bigcup_{n=1}^{\infty} \{x\in E: \omega(f;x)\ge 1/n\}.
\]

